<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.37.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 18th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Red Cactus is a tree-type material found on top of the sandstone pillars in the Desert. Its appearance is a wider (near width of full-grown redwood) red-colored cactus. Sanded wood is a whiteish-purple with no texture.\n</p><p>To obtain Red Cactus, you need to either climb the sand pillars or travel into the mountainous area of the Desert.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<p>Mutated Red Cactus found in the image to the right. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Wierd_red_cactus.png/revision/latest?cb=20241005101421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wierd red cactus\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wierd red cactus.png\" data-image-key=\"Wierd_red_cactus.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Wierd_red_cactus.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241005101421\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.noc